# Cline Rules — AI 协作协议（继承 AGENTS.md）

## 启动

```bash
cat STATUS.md
bash scripts/session/ses-context-load.sh
python3 -c "import json;print(json.load(open('.ai/tasks.json'))['next_action'])"
ls -t docs/ai/decisions/ | head -3
```

编码前确认任务 `acceptance` ready（`docs/guides/GC-task-acceptance.md`）。

## 决策流转

```
NOTE → DEC → lifecycle → wf-promote.sh → golden → gov-validate.sh → commit
```

- `bash scripts/governance/gov-next-decision.sh --create`
- 禁止直改 `docs/architecture/`；先 lifecycle 再 promote

## 文档命名

| 目录 | 格式 |
|------|------|
| `docs/guides/` | `GC-{slug}.md` |
| `docs/notes/` | `NOTE-YYYYMMDD-NNN.md` |
| `docs/ai/decisions/` | `DEC-XXX.md` |

**严禁：** v1/v2/_bak/backup/copy 后缀。

## 校验与合入

```bash
bash scripts/governance/gov-validate.sh
bash scripts/governance/gov-local-ci.sh
```

- pre-commit = simplified（compile + custom-checks）
- PR 使用仓库模板勾选 local-ci / AC（DEC-048）
- 编码约定：`docs/guides/GC-coding-conventions.md`

## 工程反思（自愿）

强制反思已拆除。教训追加 `docs/guides/GC-engineering-reflections.md`。

